11	// This file holds the single structural rule set shared by every strict JSON
12	// object decoder in this package — the submit-input heartbeat objects and the
13	// on-disk node-file envelope alike:
14	//
15	//   - the value must be one JSON object;
16	//   - within one object, a field name may appear only once, where names are
17	//     compared as the JSON strings they decode to, so a plain "missed" and a
